// Test extension for POSIF_QD: phase A on P14.7 and phase B on P14.6 (README), routed to POSIF0.IN0B and IN1B; the index input
// (POSIF0.IN2B) is only driven by the monitor. The CCU81 is replaced by a stub that raises the period match flag of slice 2
// every 20000th poll (the example prints a line each time it sees the flag).
phaseA: Miscellaneous.Button @ port14 7
    -> port14@7 | posif0@1

phaseB: Miscellaneous.Button @ port14 6
    -> port14@6 | posif0@5

ccu81: Python.PythonPeripheral @ sysbus 0x40024000
    size: 0x1000
    initable: true
    filename: "tests/platforms/xmc4500/posif_ccu8_qd_stub.py"
